   |          --+--
   |            |
   +------------+


   start
     |
     V
    / \ yes            +-------+
+->< = >----> done     | t<-d  |<--+
|   \ /                +---+---+   |
|    | no                  |       |
|    |                     V       |
|    |   +------+         / \ no   |
|    +-->| t<-a +------->< < >-----+
|        +------+         \ /
